    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract base class for animated data transitions on plot elements. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Subclasses implement <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1DataTransition_1a7f724ef15d1e432af39cc831b9a45d53" kindref="member">interpolate()</ref></computeroutput> to define how the element animates between an old dataset and a new one. The transition is driven frame-by-frame by <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1DataTransition_1a5de6c6267d3a6b329aab1a960356ab3b" kindref="member">advance()</ref></computeroutput>, which is called from the host element&apos;s <computeroutput>updatePaintNode()</computeroutput>.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1DrawTransition" kindref="compound">DrawTransition</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1MorphTransition" kindref="compound">MorphTransition</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1LineCurve" kindref="compound">LineCurve</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
